==Skin Trivia==
*The {{Color|ContentCreator|Corso}} skin is based on [https://www.youtube.com/@CORSOBLOX CORSO].
*The {{Color|Premium|DRKSHDW}} skin is based on the fashion line of the same name.
*The {{Color|Deluxe|Soviet}} chestplate appears to be based on the Stalnoi Nagrudnik (Steel Breastplate) used by Red Army Assault Sappers during World War 2.
*The {{Color|Showtime|Victorian}} skin is a submission made by [https://www.roblox.com/users/766089497/profile Null_5D].
*The {{Color|Other|Narrator}} skin is based on the [[Actor3 (Nil Zone)|Actor3]] enemy.

